{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "从左到右扫描价格，在每一天只保留此前出现过的最低价格，并计算“今天卖出”能得到的利润。若该利润超过历史最佳值，就更新最大利润；示例中最低价为第 2 天的 1，在第 5 天以 6 卖出时得到最大利润 5。对于持续下跌的第二个示例，所有候选利润都不大于 0，因此结果为 0。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>买卖股票的最佳时机</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body{\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #1c1c1c;\n    color: #d4d4d4;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  main{\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 980px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 28px 24px 40px;\n  }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #fff; font-size:14px; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 24px; color: #a9a9a9; }\n  .panel {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border: 1px solid #444;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: #252526;\n  }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 16px; color: #fff; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .prices {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(78px, 1fr));\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .day {\n    min-height: 112px;\n    padding: 12px 8px;\n    border: 2px solid #555;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background: #2d2d30;\n    text-align: center;\n    transition: background .35s, border-color .35s;\n  }\n  .day.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .day.minimum { border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .day.best { background: #0e639c; border-color: #72b7ff; }\n  .index { color: #aaa; font-size: 13px; }\n  .price {\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    color: #eee;\n    font: 700 14px/1.2 \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace;\n  }\n  .marker { min-height: 24px; color: #9cdcfe; font-size: 13px; }\n  .stats {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(150px, 1fr));\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .stat {\n    padding: 16px;\n    border: 1px solid #444;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background: #252526;\n  }\n  .stat-label { margin-bottom: 6px; color: #aaa; }\n  .stat-value { color: #3794ff; font: 700 23px/1.3 \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .explain {\n    min-height: 68px;\n    padding: 15px 16px;\n    border-left: 4px solid #3794ff;\n    background: #252526;\n  }\n  .formula { color: #ce9178; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .result {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    padding: 18px;\n    border: 1px solid #0e639c;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    background: #252526;\n  }\n  .result strong { color: #3794ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .secondary {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n  }\n  .small-cell {\n    min-width: 58px;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    border: 1px solid #555;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 720px) {\n    main{ padding: 20px 14px 32px; }\n    .prices { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(76px, 1fr)); }\n    .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 390px) {\n    .prices { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(76px, 1fr)); }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}main{max-width:560px!important;padding:8px 10px 10px!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.intro{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.panel,.stat{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-top:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.panel-title{font-size:13px!important;margin-bottom:6px!important}.prices{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr)!important;gap:6px!important}.day{min-height:auto!important;padding:6px 4px!important}.price{font-size:13px!important}.index,.marker{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)!important;gap:6px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important}.stat-value{font-size:13px!important}.explain{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important}.result{padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.small-cell{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:12px!important;min-width:auto!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>一次扫描：让卖出日始终晚于买入日</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">示例 1：prices = [7, 1, 5, 3, 6, 4]。蓝色格表示当前扫描到的日期。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">每日价格与状态</div>\n    <div class=\"prices\" id=\"prices\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stats\">\n    <div class=\"stat\">\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">当前天</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"currentDay\">第 1 天</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat\">\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">截至当前日最低价</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"minPrice\">7</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat\">\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">历史最大利润</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"maxProfit\">0</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\"></div>\n\n  <section class=\"result\">\n    最佳交易：第 2 天以 <strong>1</strong> 买入，第 5 天以 <strong>6</strong> 卖出，最大利润为 <strong>6 - 1 = 5</strong>。\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">为什么下跌序列返回 0？</div>\n    <div>示例 2 的价格持续降低，每天卖出都无法产生正利润，因此选择不交易。</div>\n    <div class=\"secondary\">\n      <div class=\"small-cell\">7</div><div class=\"small-cell\">6</div><div class=\"small-cell\">4</div><div class=\"small-cell\">3</div><div class=\"small-cell\">1</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:12px\">最大利润：<span class=\"formula\">0</span></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const values = [7, 1, 5, 3, 6, 4];\n  const container = document.getElementById('prices');\n  const currentDay = document.getElementById('currentDay');\n  const minPriceEl = document.getElementById('minPrice');\n  const maxProfitEl = document.getElementById('maxProfit');\n  const explain = document.getElementById('explain');\n\n  values.forEach(function (value, index) {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'day';\n    cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"index\">第 ' + (index + 1) + ' 天</div><div class=\"price\">' + value + '</div><div class=\"marker\"></div>';\n    container.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n\n  const cells = Array.from(container.children);\n  let step = 0;\n\n  function render(index) {\n    let minPrice = values[0];\n    let minIndex = 0;\n    let best = 0;\n    let bestSell = -1;\n\n    for (let i = 1; i <= index; i++) {\n      const profit = values[i] - minPrice;\n      if (profit > best) {\n        best = profit;\n        bestSell = i;\n      }\n      if (values[i] < minPrice) {\n        minPrice = values[i];\n        minIndex = i;\n      }\n    }\n\n    cells.forEach(function (cell, i) {\n      cell.className = 'day';\n      cell.querySelector('.marker').textContent = '';\n      if (i === index) cell.classList.add('current');\n      if (i === minIndex) {\n        cell.classList.add('minimum');\n        cell.querySelector('.marker').textContent = '最低买入价';\n      }\n      if (i === bestSell && i === index) {\n        cell.classList.add('best');\n        cell.querySelector('.marker').textContent = '刷新最佳卖出日';\n      }\n    });\n\n    currentDay.textContent = '第 ' + (index + 1) + ' 天';\n    minPriceEl.textContent = String(minPrice);\n    maxProfitEl.textContent = String(best);\n\n    if (index === 0) {\n      explain.innerHTML = '先把第 1 天价格 <span class=\"formula\">7</span> 作为最低价。此时还没有未来日期可卖出，利润为 <span class=\"formula\">0</span>。';\n    } else {\n      const priorMin = Math.min.apply(null, values.slice(0, index));\n      const candidate = values[index] - priorMin;\n      if (values[index] < priorMin) {\n        explain.innerHTML = '今天价格 <span class=\"formula\">' + values[index] + '</span> 更低，更新最低买入价；买入日只会向后移动，不会出现“先卖后买”。';\n      } else if (candidate > 0 && candidate === best) {\n        explain.innerHTML = '若今天卖出，候选利润为 <span class=\"formula\">' + values[index] + ' - ' + priorMin + ' = ' + candidate + '</span>，与历史最佳比较后保留较大值。';\n      } else {\n        explain.innerHTML = '若今天卖出，候选利润为 <span class=\"formula\">' + values[index] + ' - ' + priorMin + ' = ' + candidate + '</span>，没有超过当前最大利润。';\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  render(step);\n  setInterval(function () {\n    step = (step + 1) % values.length;\n    render(step);\n  }, 1900);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
